     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.PlanIterations</b></p><a name=\"SGAuthoring.Skills.PlanIterations\"> </a><a name=\"hcSGAuthoring.Skills.PlanIterations\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>These requirements apply to the actor <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.ProgrammeManager.html\">Programme Manager</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"ITERATE-01\"> </a></b>Maintain DAK backlog</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can create and maintain a prioritized, estimated backlog of work items, decomposing big items into smaller items accomplishable in days.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ITERATE-02\"> </a></b>Plan iteration scope</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can plan fixed-length iterations (1 month or less) considering team capacity, prior results, and backlog items.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ITERATE-03\"> </a></b>Define iteration goals</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can define iteration goals that create coherence and focus for the team during each sprint.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ITERATE-04\"> </a></b>Facilitate retrospectives</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHOULD\">SHOULD</a></td><td><div><p>Can facilitate retrospective meetings to assess what went well, identify problems, and improve team effectiveness.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"ITERATE-05\"> </a></b>Draft project roadmap</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can draft a project roadmap with estimates for each phase and key milestone dates.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.PlanIterations</b></p><a name=\"fr-SGAuthoring.Skills.PlanIterations\"> </a><a name=\"fr-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.PlanIterations\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profil: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>Ces exigences s'appliquent à l'acteur <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.ProgrammeManager.html\">Programme Manager</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-ITERATE-01\"> </a></b>Maintain DAK backlog</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can create and maintain a prioritized, estimated backlog of work items, decomposing big items into smaller items accomplishable in days.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-ITERATE-02\"> </a></b>Plan iteration scope</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can plan fixed-length iterations (1 month or less) considering team capacity, prior results, and backlog items.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-ITERATE-03\"> </a></b>Define iteration goals</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can define iteration goals that create coherence and focus for the team during each sprint.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-ITERATE-04\"> </a></b>Facilitate retrospectives</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHOULD\">SHOULD</a></td><td><div><p>Can facilitate retrospective meetings to assess what went well, identify problems, and improve team effectiveness.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-ITERATE-05\"> </a></b>Draft project roadmap</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can draft a project roadmap with estimates for each phase and key milestone dates.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><hr/><p><b>Arabic</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>السرد المُنشأ: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.PlanIterations</b></p><a name=\"ar-SGAuthoring.Skills.PlanIterations\"> </a><a name=\"ar-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.PlanIterations\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">الملف الشخصي: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>تنطبق هذه المتطلبات على الممثل <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.ProgrammeManager.html\">Programme Manager</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"ar-ITERATE-01\"> </a></b>Maintain DAK backlog</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r